        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brutal Brawls in the Wild West</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brawlers of the West: Prologue</strong> is a <strong>free, physics-based Western brawler</strong> delivering brutal close-quarters combat in the lawless frontier. Every punch, kick, shove, and throw is driven by physics, creating raw, unpredictable brawls where no two fights play out the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This prologue offers a focused taste of the full game’s combat system, atmosphere, and game modes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Physics-Based Melee Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is fully driven by physics. Strikes carry real weight, enemies lose balance, collide with the environment, and react dynamically to every hit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timing, positioning, and aggression define every encounter. One well-placed blow can end a fight — while reckless movement leaves you exposed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn the Environment Against Your Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environment is part of the fight.<br>Smash bottles, break furniture, and slam enemies into walls to gain the upper hand. Each arena supports <strong>emergent, unscripted combat</strong>, ensuring chaotic and memorable brawls.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Playable Modes in the Free Prologue</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss of the Saloon</strong> – Face powerful opponents in intense boss encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Mayhem</strong> – Four teams of two battle until only one team remains</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These modes are available in the Prologue with a <strong>limited selection of levels</strong>, offering a strong preview of the full game’s variety and intensity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Fight Continues</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Prologue is only the beginning. The full version of <strong>Brawlers of the West</strong> expands the experience with more arenas, fighters, game modes, and escalating challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist the full game</strong> to follow development and be ready for the complete Wild West brawling experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
