ing. The full version of <strong>Brawlers of the West</strong> expands the experience with more arenas, fighters, game modes, and escalating challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist the full game</strong> to follow development and be ready for the complete Wild West brawling experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
